    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970415.0304\n\nMOSCOW, April 15 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nURGENT Russia, NATO \"getting closer\" after Moscow talks\n\n\n\n\nNATO and Russia \"getting closer\" to an accord on future relations, the Russian foreign ministry said Tuesday after talks between NATO Secretary General Javier Solana and Foreign Minister Yevgeny Primakov.",
